# Template for `.env`, which holds local secrets and is gitignored (`*.env`).
# Copy to `.env` and fill in the values:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Every `just` recipe loads `.env` automatically (`set dotenv-load := true`),
# so `just run` picks these up with no wrapper.
#
# One variable is required per RPC provider that declares an `api_key` in the
# chains config the run is pointed at — startup fails, naming the chain, the
# provider and the exact variable, when one is unset or empty.
#
# Naming: INTERCHAIN_INDEXER_RPC_API_KEY__<CHAIN_ID>__<PROVIDER>
# (provider uppercased, every character outside [A-Z0-9_] replaced by `_`),
# or whatever `api_key.value_env` names instead. See config/ENVs.md.

# Required by config/full-mainnet/chains.json:
# chain 8021 (NUMINE Mainnet), provider "glacier" — header x-glacier-api-key
INTERCHAIN_INDEXER_RPC_API_KEY__8021__GLACIER=
